{"3488670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Villainville", "steam_appid": 3488670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/ad421e0bd8aaec12406aced2f2f8c006.avif?t=1785612547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras_big/ad421e0bd8aaec12406aced2f2f8c006.webp?t=1785612547 width=1560 height=403 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Godmothers lied to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They've always said that so long as you stick to your godmother-approved story, everything will work out. You'll get your happily ever after. Turns out that's not so true for you...or for a whole island full of villains and misfits.<br><br>You arrive as a bankrupt royal on the run from your kingdom’s creditors--your grandpappy King Midas really did LOVE gold. After you customize your new look (aka disguise) you'll set out to build a life on the island of Batwing. You can't go back, but maybe as you go forward you'll find friends. Companionship. Even...a found family?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/aee11df4aaf21d9c0d27cdc78c5ea45a.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/aee11df4aaf21d9c0d27cdc78c5ea45a.webm?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/aee11df4aaf21d9c0d27cdc78c5ea45a.mp4?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the villains of Batwing Island are being sanctioned and isolated thanks to a plague of misery mushrooms. They're a rough group to begin with, and now Stepmother Carina--the godmothers' representative--is pointing fingers and stirring up suspicion over who started the plague. Can you forge the ragtag group of outcasts into a community, and stand up to the Organization of Godmothers' rules? They've cast you out, certain none of you deserve a happily ever after, but you're about to prove them wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/55cc9804ab8e032f130cd715010c96e2.avif?t=1785612547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras_big/55cc9804ab8e032f130cd715010c96e2.webp?t=1785612547 width=1560 height=403 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow magic crops, from ghost peppers that let you talk to ghosts, to pumpkins that ripen into jack-o-lanterns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a look that's truly you–complete with tattoos and horns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside your rusty old weapons–you’ll be searching out tool treasures such as an epic axe that takes out an entire swath of trees with one throw</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/02dab5195ac29273b8bd19036ca65137.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=438 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/02dab5195ac29273b8bd19036ca65137.webm?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/02dab5195ac29273b8bd19036ca65137.mp4?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the rich stories behind Batwing Island’s 60+ upended fairytale NPCs to forge friendships, resolve fights, and create a community out of outlaws</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/b17a0b7d731fbff7460b8680f91442c4.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/b17a0b7d731fbff7460b8680f91442c4.webm?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/b17a0b7d731fbff7460b8680f91442c4.mp4?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the island’s underbelly to sleuth out the truth of who started the misery plague in a player-responsive story with mini mysteries and multiple outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise enchanting farm animals to restore the protective magic of the land–including tiny darling but deadly unicorns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/31b22d6d0d79846efd236b7312a032ca.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=356 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/31b22d6d0d79846efd236b7312a032ca.webm?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/31b22d6d0d79846efd236b7312a032ca.mp4?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover found family as you bond with the island’s more than 60 reimagined fairy tale characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/4e5a3637bb335a061d9b58ba4d279341.avif?t=1785612547\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the island’s night market and meet your fellow creatures of the moon, with quests, NPCs, and shops that cater to the nocturnal types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/d76360273525713dd5f767559f7d4a47.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=300 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/d76360273525713dd5f767559f7d4a47.webm?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/d76360273525713dd5f767559f7d4a47.mp4?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and befriend island fae such as pixies, nixies, and poison dryads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8013141ffcdcf26a85ba89f2996b179e.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=294 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8013141ffcdcf26a85ba89f2996b179e.webm?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8013141ffcdcf26a85ba89f2996b179e.mp4?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/5dd89b21987ec58597cc98fbdab30315.avif?t=1785612547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras_big/5dd89b21987ec58597cc98fbdab30315.webp?t=1785612547 width=1560 height=403 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villainville is a big game from a tiny team. It  has been in development for more than three years--but we're approaching the early access stage and looking for playtesters to help us bring it home! Please sign up to playtest--for free--above. We update new content to the playtest build approx. 1-2 times per month.</strong>  <br><br>As a team we're creating a space for our passion project despite a host of entirely too 'fun' medical challenges, a teeny tiny misdemeanor, and careers that liked to do hand stands. As for the husband-wife team of core developers? Ask anyone and they'll tell you they're much too old to make games. In fact, they're soon-to-be grandparents. And yet, here it is.<br><br>    EVERYONE who works on this game is mortal and human--whether we want to be or not. As a game development team we do NOT use generative AI ourselves, or work with any contractor or marketing partner who uses AI.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/2226789d4d2b36cc045966733400fb02.avif?t=1785612547\" width=1555 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please WISHLIST  Villainville (above^^^) and share with friends. Your support helps the team as we create a game that's a heart strong positive place for ALL of us!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8776246ae1d50fb78236e5f551c6f48a.avif?t=1785612547\" width=312 height=420 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/ad421e0bd8aaec12406aced2f2f8c006.avif?t=1785612547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras_big/ad421e0bd8aaec12406aced2f2f8c006.webp?t=1785612547 width=1560 height=403 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Godmothers lied to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They've always said that so long as you stick to your godmother-approved story, everything will work out. You'll get your happily ever after. Turns out that's not so true for you...or for a whole island full of villains and misfits.<br><br>You arrive as a bankrupt royal on the run from your kingdom’s creditors--your grandpappy King Midas really did LOVE gold. After you customize your new look (aka disguise) you'll set out to build a life on the island of Batwing. You can't go back, but maybe as you go forward you'll find friends. Companionship. Even...a found family?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/aee11df4aaf21d9c0d27cdc78c5ea45a.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/a