ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8013141ffcdcf26a85ba89f2996b179e.poster.avif?t=1785612547\" width=294 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8013141ffcdcf26a85ba89f2996b179e.webm?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8013141ffcdcf26a85ba89f2996b179e.mp4?t=1785612547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/5dd89b21987ec58597cc98fbdab30315.avif?t=1785612547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras_big/5dd89b21987ec58597cc98fbdab30315.webp?t=1785612547 width=1560 height=403 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villainville is a big game from a tiny team. It  has been in development for more than three years--but we're approaching the early access stage and looking for playtesters to help us bring it home! Please sign up to playtest--for free--above. We update new content to the playtest build approx. 1-2 times per month.</strong>  <br><br>As a team we're creating a space for our passion project despite a host of entirely too 'fun' medical challenges, a teeny tiny misdemeanor, and careers that liked to do hand stands. As for the husband-wife team of core developers? Ask anyone and they'll tell you they're much too old to make games. In fact, they're soon-to-be grandparents. And yet, here it is.<br><br>    EVERYONE who works on this game is mortal and human--whether we want to be or not. As a game development team we do NOT use generative AI ourselves, or work with any contractor or marketing partner who uses AI.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/2226789d4d2b36cc045966733400fb02.avif?t=1785612547\" width=1555 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please WISHLIST  Villainville (above^^^) and share with friends. Your support helps the team as we create a game that's a heart strong positive place for ALL of us!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8776246ae1d50fb78236e5f551c6f48a.avif?t=1785612547\" width=312 height=420 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Join the outcasts of Villainville in this cozy farming sim adventure where Stardew Valley meets Shrek. Grow magic crops, tame the tiny unicorns, sneak into the night market, and befriend misfit fairy tale characters. Bonus? Find the misery mushroom plague saboteur and redeem the irredeemable.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/5fcc5cc05fb29210b12ec55cfa485a059b413511/header.jpg?t=1785612547", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/c244ff7ac8c3ce9bece121837c98a82af0c14651/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785612547", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/c244ff7ac8c3ce9bece121837c98a82af0c14651/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785612547", "website": "https://flamingacorngames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Flaming Aco